<div id="S5.SS1.p26" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S5.SS1.p26.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="73.07" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 73.07" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,73.07) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#404040;" fill="#404040" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 67.16 C 0 70.42 2.64 73.07 5.91 73.07 L 471.47 73.07 C 474.73 73.07 477.38 70.42 477.38 67.16 L 477.38 5.91 C 477.38 2.64 474.73 0 471.47 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2F2F2;" fill="#F2F2F2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 67.16 C 1.97 69.34 3.73 71.1 5.91 71.1 L 471.47 71.1 C 473.65 71.1 475.41 69.34 475.41 67.16 L 475.41 5.91 C 475.41 3.73 473.65 1.97 471.47 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.47)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:31.37em;--ltx-fo-height:3.09em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="45.51" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 42.82)" width="434.07"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="S5.SS1.p26.pic1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:31.37em;">
<span id="S5.SS1.p26.pic1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.SS1.p26.pic1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Finding 7<span id="S5.SS1.p26.pic1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium">: We identified one case, shown in Listing <a href="#LST6" title="Listing 6 ‣ 5.1 Issue Detection and Attempts to Fix Code using ChatGPT ‣ 5 Detection and Correction ‣ Secure Coding with AI – From Creation to Inspection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>, where ChatGPT outperformed static scanners by providing a more accurate analysis.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS1.p27" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS1.p27.1" class="ltx_p">In another case, in the folder File_61 of the results repository [29], the lack of a constructor and the uninitialized private member ’balance’ was implicitly corrected by ChatGPT without reporting CWE numbers when we asked it to spot and fix security issues using our prompt. This can be seen in the Listing <a href="#LST7" title="Listing 7 ‣ 5.1 Issue Detection and Attempts to Fix Code using ChatGPT ‣ 5 Detection and Correction ‣ Secure Coding with AI – From Creation to Inspection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>.</p>
</div>
